@host = http://localhost:8080
@id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Categories
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### Create; replace id above with response id
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Принтер","description":"Не печатает","categoryId":1,"priority":"HIGH","dueAt":"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z"}

### Get
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/{{id}}

### Edit
PUT {{host}}/api/tickets/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Проверить кабель","priority":"MEDIUM","dueAt":null}

### Start
PATCH {{host}}/api/tickets/{{id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"IN_PROGRESS"}

### Resolve
PATCH {{host}}/api/tickets/{{id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"RESOLVED"}

### History
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/{{id}}/history

### Search
GET {{host}}/api/tickets?status=NEW&priority=HIGH&page=0&size=20

### Summary
GET {{host}}/api/reports/summary?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2027-01-01T00:00:00Z
